  "baseline_note": "Pinned author sources used as a teaching case for reusable reveal transitions and their rendering boundaries. The sample dependency pins Flutter Scene. Flutter 3.44.0 is a separate API comparison baseline, not a claim about the SDK used to build the sample. Source hashes and literal assertions establish source identity and entry points, not runtime performance. Coordinate-system caveats, optimization options and controlled comparisons are engineering deductions; arithmetic examples are illustrative. No device frame-time, GPU, power or memory measurements are asserted. Upstream LICENSE files were read at the pinned revisions. Only metadata and links are retained in this evidence package.",
